# Smart Delivery Management System

A simple **C# Console Application** built to practice and demonstrate **Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)** concepts.

## Technologies Used

* C#
* .NET
* Console Application

## OOP Concepts Used

* Classes & Structs
* Encapsulation
* Inheritance
* Polymorphism
* Constructors & Constructor Chaining
* Properties (Getters & Setters)
* Method Overriding
* Indexers
* Arrays
* Validation
* Value Types & Reference Types

## Shipment Types

The system supports three shipment types:

* `StandardShipment`
* `ExpressShipment`
* `InternationalShipment`

Each shipment type inherits from the base `Shipment` class and has its own cost calculation when needed.

## Main Features

* Create a delivery center.
* Add shipments to the delivery center.
* Search for shipments using tracking codes.
* Remove shipments using tracking codes.
* Print all stored shipments.
* Calculate estimated shipment costs.
* Handle different shipment types using inheritance and polymorphism.

## Project Purpose

This project was created as an **OOP practice assignment** to strengthen understanding of C# object-oriented programming concepts and their practical implementation.
